    "accordion": {
      "type": "custom-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "panel_trial": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "summary": "Sleep trial and returns",
            "callout": "100 nights as standard. 200 nights when a mattress protector is included in the order.",
            "content": "<p>Sleep on it at home and really put it to the test. If it doesn't live up to expectations, send it back for a full refund with no collection charge. We ask that you give it 30 nights to bed in first, so your body has time to adjust.</p>\n<p>One trial per address. The mattress must be kept clean — a £35 cleaning fee applies to soiled returns, and severely soiled returns may be refused. Collections are handled by the British Heart Foundation or Rhenus Logistics, and refunds are issued within five working days of collection.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "panel_delivery": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "summary": "Delivery",
            "callout": "",
            "content": "<p>Free 2–5 day delivery to UK addresses, by a two-person team, to your room of choice. Delivered rolled and bagged.</p>\n<p>Some further-reaching postcodes in Scotland, Northern Ireland and the islands are on longer lead times — enter your address at checkout for your area.</p>\n<p>The courier contacts you by email and WhatsApp with a choice of dates, then gives a three-hour window the day before and a call 30 minutes out. Old mattress collection and recycling is available at checkout for a small fee.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "panel_sizes": {
