          "settings": {
            "summary": "15-year guarantee",
            "callout": "",
            "content": "<p>Every new REM-Fit mattress comes with up to a 15-year guarantee at no extra cost — one year for rejuvenated models. Set it on a supportive base and you're covered.</p>\n<p>On a replacement your original guarantee period continues; on an upgrade you pay the difference. Returns must be unstained and claimed by the original buyer. Remember to register your guarantee.</p>",
